  - tutorialIndex: 1
    title: Welcome
    description: 'Welcome to Mining Fever!


      Simply move your cursor over ores
      to dig.

      Upgrade with your collected ores to get even more resources!


      Let
      the mining begin!'
    icon: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialIndex: 2
    title: Craft New Pickaxes
    description: 
    icon: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialIndex: 3
    title: Special Skills
    description: 'Right-click to activate your special skills during the game!

      Each
      skill has a limited number of uses per session, but refills every new session.


      Explore
      various effects and choose the ones that best fit your playstyle!'
    icon: {fileID: 0}
  - tutorialIndex: 4
    title: Artifacts
    description: 'View all artifacts acquired during your session here.

      Equip
      them to activate their powerful effects!


      Equip slots are limited, so
      experiment with different combinations!'
    icon: {fileID: 0}
